=== Resource Transfer Sample ===
--- 1. Owned parameter released where it was not dropped ---
  DropWhen(early=False) leaving
  Token(1) released
  Token(2) released
  DropWhen(early=True) leaving
--- 2. Plain parameter returned on one path ---
  Pass(true) handed back Token(3)
  Token(3) released
  Pass(false) keeps Token(4)
  Token(4) released
  Pass(false) made Token(104)
  Token(104) released
--- 3. A local shadowing a parameter is its own value ---
  Token(1005) released
  Shadow leaving
  Token(5) released
--- 4. A Drop releases the fields its body left ---
  Token(8) released
  Pair.Drop(dropFirst=True) body done
  Token(9) released
  Pair.Drop(dropFirst=False) body done
  Token(6) released
  Token(7) released
--- 5. A with releases the value it was given ---
  inside with(t)
  Token(10) released
  after with(t)
  inside the branch's with
  Token(11) released
  WithOnOneBranch(enter=True) leaving
  WithOnOneBranch(enter=False) leaving
  Token(12) released
  inner and outer held
  Token(14) released
  Token(13) released
  Consume took Token(15)
  Token(15) released
  scoped value handed on inside its with
--- 6. A for initializer is released when the loop is left ---
  loop body sees Token(16)
  Token(16) released
  Token(17) released
--- 7. A linear ref struct follows the same paths ---
  LeaseWhen(early=False) leaving
  Lease(18) released
  Lease(19) released
  LeaseWhen(early=True) leaving
--- 8. A pattern binding hands on what it views ---
  Consume took Token(20)
  Token(20) released
  after the pattern
--- 9. A deconstructed element is owned by its target ---
  deconstructed twenty-one into Token(21)
  Token(21) released
--- 10. A value stored in a field belongs to its container ---
  Keeper took Token(22)
  Token(22) released
--- 11. A lease is released by its owner, a lent value by its lender ---
  Look sees Token(23)
  owner still holds its value
  Token(23) released
  Look sees Token(24)
  Token(24) released
  after lending a fresh value
--- 12. A call that is skipped leaves the value with the caller ---
  Maybe leaving
  Token(25) released
  Box used Token(26)
  Token(26) released
  Maybe leaving
=== Resource Transfer Done ===
